    "segments": [
      {
        "seconds": 8.008,
        "narration": "今年四站大满贯，菲斯只赢了一场比赛。可今年的年终名单里，第一次出现了他的名字。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+0Hz"
        },
        "image": "assets/reel/fils-finals-road-2026/photo-sequences/opening.mp4",
        "image_kind": "photo"
      },
      {
        "seconds": 9.064,
        "narration": "去年法网后，背伤让他只又打了两场巡回赛单打。今年又缺席澳网，直到二月才开始新赛季。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+0Hz"
        },
        "image": "assets/reel/fils-finals-road-2026/photo-sequences/recovery.mp4",
        "image_kind": "photo"
      },
      {
        "seconds": 7.984,
        "narration": "复出第三站，多哈。他一路打到决赛，却以二比六、一比六输给阿尔卡拉斯。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+0Hz"
        },
        "image": "assets/reel/fils-finals-road-2026/photo-sequences/doha.mp4",
        "image_kind": "photo"
      },
      {
        "seconds": 9.712,
        "narration": "印第安维尔斯打进8强。接着是迈阿密，对保罗那场四分之一决赛，他救回四个赛点，三盘抢七翻了回来。",
        "voice": {
          "pitch": "+0Hz"
        },
        "image": "assets/reel/fils-finals-road-2026/photo-sequences/sunshine.mp4",
        "image_kind": "photo"
      },
      {
        "source": "miami-qf",
        "start": 0.0,
        "end": 40.0,
        "fit": "crop",
        "cx": 0.5,
        "track": false,
        "narration": "",
        "audio_tail": "silence",
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 18.14,
            "end": 19.36,
            "text": "He's done it!\n他做到了！"
          },
          {
            "at": 20.36,
            "end": 21.6,
            "text": "What a conclusion!\n多么精彩的结局！"
          },
          {
            "at": 21.96,
            "end": 26.38,
            "text": "Arthur Fils is a Miami semi-finalist.\n菲斯晋级迈阿密半决赛。"
          },
          {
            "at": 26.4,
            "end": 28.32,
            "text": "Can you believe it?\n你敢相信吗？"
          },
          {
            "at": 28.82,
            "end": 31.22,
            "text": "Six-two down in the breaker.\n抢七一度2比6落后。"
          },
          {
            "at": 32.8,
            "end": 39.74,
            "text": "And somehow he's found a way.\n可他竟然找到了出路。"
          }
        ],
